d file is kept). A test can fake an","+older version by writing a file and adding its sha256 to the installed","+manifest. Reuse them for any other check against the manifest"," (e.g. `doctor`) rather than hashing files again. `install` rejects"," options it does not know, so a new install flag must be added to"," `parseInstallArgs` in `src/cli.ts`."]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/nick/code/tiiny_router_hermes.review-fix/AGENTS.md"]}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_012GqcZCft6Nb1tEeAhdVimJ","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
